XenonRecomp
TODO.md

# Local AI session handoff notes (not for the repo)
docs/chat-handoff.md
# Private AI-agent workflow docs (slots, locks, agent shader cache, playtest copy, heavy tools). Kept on disk
# in the main checkout; tools/fable2_slots.py links it into every agent slot. No trailing slash in the pattern:
# the slot copy is a symlink, which a directory-only pattern would not match.
/docs-private
# Paused save-state work (continuation codegen) and other local-only code, kept on disk in the main checkout with
# its repo-relative paths (private/save-states/<path>). tests/private_docs_tests.py keeps tracked files from naming it.
/private

# Controller View-button screenshots (src/input/controller_hotkeys.h)
Screenshots/

